  "label": "Ernie is mapped as the minority locked in his oven",
  "description": "The hateful text overlay explicitly states 'what type of minority is locked in his oven', directly mapping the visual entity Ernie to the role of 'minority locked in his oven'. This is a deliberate and harmful analogical mapping that weaponizes Ernie's innocent, childlike appearance to deliver an antisemitic stereotype. The text positions Ernie as the subject of the metaphor, creating a jarring juxtaposition where the non-threatening Muppet character is equated with a persecuted minority group in a violent, dehumanizing context.",
